This repository is licensed under a split license.

  driver/                     GPL-2.0-only   (see LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt)
  everything else             CC-BY-4.0      (see LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt)

"Everything else" covers documentation, measurement data and tools -- i.e. the
whole tree except `driver/`.

Rationale: `driver/cf-sv1-platform_profile-quirk.patch` modifies the Linux
kernel driver `drivers/platform/x86/panasonic-laptop.c` (SPDX
`GPL-2.0-only`) and is intended for the upstream kernel, so it carries the
kernel's license. The workbook around it (docs and data) is published under
CC-BY-4.0.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only AND CC-BY-4.0
(per-path identifiers apply; the machine-readable form is in `REUSE.toml`,
which is the authoritative mapping — this file is the human summary).

Attribution for the CC-BY-4.0 parts:
  Wu Zhipeng <zepwu@foxmail.com>, "CF-SV1-2 platform_profile upstream workbook",
  https://github.com/numuly/cf-sv1-2-platform-profile-evidence

(The public repository above holds the published evidence and documentation;
this workbook is the working copy it is curated from.)
